1. Introduction

1.1 Purpose

This Software Requirements Specification (SRS) defines the functional and non-functional requirements for Smart Property, a comprehensive enterprise PropTech platform that digitizes the entire property lifecycle.

The document serves as the technical blueprint for software engineers, solution architects, product managers, QA engineers, DevOps engineers, UI/UX designers, and project stakeholders.

---

2. Product Overview

Smart Property is a unified digital real estate ecosystem that enables users to:

- Buy, rent and sell properties
- Manage estates
- Manage shortlets
- Hire verified professionals
- Pay rent and utility bills
- Pay with cryptocurrency or traditional payment methods
- Invest in tokenized real estate
- Verify properties through the Smart Trust process
- Store and manage BIM models
- Capture GIS coordinates
- Track complete property history
- Manage digital property documents

---

3. Business Goals

The system shall:

- Reduce real estate fraud
- Increase trust in property transactions
- Digitize property verification
- Enable secure digital documentation
- Improve property management
- Simplify property investment
- Improve agent productivity
- Support digital property ownership
- Enable blockchain-backed trust certification

---

