Module 4 — Smart Trust™

The Smart Trust™ process validates every property before certification.

Workflow

1. Property Submission
2. Document Verification
3. Survey Verification
4. Physical Inspection
5. Property Valuation
6. Legal Due Diligence
7. Administrative Approval
8. Blockchain Registration
9. Smart Trust Certificate Issuance

Trust Status

- Draft
- Submitted
- Under Review
- Documents Verified
- Survey Verified
- Valuation Complete
- Legal Cleared
- Approved
- Blockchain Registered
- Certified
